sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State: State is EnergyTransferStarted

    Note over CS,CSMS: Note: Step 1 is executed after the configured transaction duration is reached.<br>This causes the transaction to stop.

    Note over CS,CSMS: 1. Execute Reusable State EVDisconnected
    Note right of CS: The TransactionEventRequest containing eventType Ended contains the MeterValue field<br>timestamp: the intervals between the timestamps of the received Meter Value messages equal<br>the configured value at configured clock-aligned Tx ended Meter Values interval<br>sampledValue.context is Sample.Clock AND the last one has Transaction.End
